        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors include specialty and other large pharmaceutical companies, medical device companies, biotechnology companies, OTC companies and generic manufacturers, in the U.S., Canada, Europe, Asia, Latin America, Middle East, Africa and in other countries in which we market our products.",
